{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y的定时感受词一闪而过，观众若正读话句或专注听音乐，容易错过；X的静态双栏更方便随时回扫。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用重点词加亮，让观众能迅速抓住每段人物心理变化的核心，而不是在长句和一堆短词之间自行寻找重点。感受按音乐实际进程出现，又把力度、节奏、音色、旋律变化与人物的情绪反应联系起来，因此不仅能感受到怀念、委屈、孤单和犹疑的细微差别，也更容易理解这些情绪为什么发生、怎样相互转化，以及最终如何走向自我接纳和继续生活。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "bee352b7-42e9-4bb2-9048-5ae36dd06e07", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T052901217160Z", "elapsed_seconds": 55.063, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T05:29:56.290552+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "3a7b1e13410094f8a1ee43dcd351c9ee3a6491483c127fe8225c1b7f81c03abc", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa238